From: Enceka <enceka@yeah.net>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: bind PON authorization to the lifecycle owner

Publish complete authorization sets only against a live, exact return binding
and current GEM map while FE and bank1 are closed. Retain attempted admission
until acknowledged close, including lost BEGIN/ADD/ARM replies. Recheck the
mapping generation after publication and validate AUTH again at reopen READY.
Hardware qualification and the remaining reopen steps stay disabled.

